\begin_layout Standard
The modulus of the fluctuations wave vector, 
\begin_inset Formula $\widetilde{k}$
\end_inset

, has been measured experimentally with several diagnostic techniques
\begin_inset CommandInset citation
LatexCommand cite
key "Zou,Ger,Ritz"

\end_inset

; 
\begin_inset Formula $\widetilde{k}$
\end_inset

 varies from values of the order of 
\begin_inset Formula $\widetilde{k}\approx0.005cm^{-1}=0.5m^{-1}$
\end_inset

, to values of the order of 
\begin_inset Formula $\widetilde{k}\approx10^{3}m^{-1}$
\end_inset

, that is of the same order of the perpendicular incident lower hybrid wave
 vector, 
\begin_inset Formula $k_{\perp}\approx10^{3}m^{-1}$
\end_inset

.
 From these experimental studies it has been observed that 
\begin_inset Formula $\widetilde{k}_{\Vert}\ll\widetilde{k}_{\bot}$
\end_inset

 and 
\begin_inset Formula $\widetilde{\lambda}_{\Vert}\gg\widetilde{\lambda}_{\perp}$
\end_inset

, so we can approximate 
\begin_inset Formula $\widetilde{k}\simeq\widetilde{k}_{\perp}$
\end_inset

 and the component of the scattered wave vector becomes 
\begin_inset Formula $\check{k}_{\parallel}=k_{\parallel}$
\end_inset

 and 
\begin_inset Formula $\check{k}_{\perp}=k_{\perp}+\widetilde{k}_{\perp}$
\end_inset

 ; for small values of 
\begin_inset Formula $\widetilde{k}_{\perp}$
\end_inset

, 
\begin_inset Formula $\check{k}=k$
\end_inset

 and we have like-mode scattering, for values of 
\begin_inset Formula $\widetilde{k}_{\perp}$
\end_inset

 of the same order of 
\begin_inset Formula $k_{\perp}$
\end_inset

, 
\begin_inset Formula $\check{k}\neq k$
\end_inset

 and we have unlike-mode scattering.
 From the experiments it has been demonstrated the relation 
\begin_inset Formula $\widetilde{\lambda}_{\Vert}\simeq(0.1-0.3)qR_{0},$
\end_inset

 
\begin_inset CommandInset citation
LatexCommand cite
key "Truc,Zweb"

\end_inset

, and as a consequence 
\begin_inset Formula $\widetilde{k}_{\Vert}\simeq2\pi/(0.1-0.3)qR_{0},$
\end_inset

