\begin_inset Formula \[
=e_{x}X_{zx}\left(\check{e}_{x}^{\star}\check{X}_{xy}+\check{e}_{y}^{\star}\check{X}_{yy}+\check{e}_{z}^{\star}\check{X}_{zy}\right)-e_{x}X_{yx}\left(\check{e}_{x}^{\star}\check{X}_{xz}+\check{e}_{y}^{\star}\check{X}_{yz}+\check{e}_{z}^{\star}\check{X}_{zz}\right)+\]

