\begin_layout Standard
\begin_inset Formula \[
=\left(e_{x}X_{yx}+e_{y}X_{yy}+e_{z}X_{yz}\right)\left(\check{e}_{x}^{\star}\check{X}_{xx}+\check{e}_{y}\check{X}_{yx}+\check{e}_{z}^{\star}\check{X}_{zx}\right)-\]

